WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Create a batch
Set a batch name, number of codes, and an optional prefix. All codes
share the discount and eligibility rules.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Export the codes
Open Coupon batches and choose Download CSV on the batch you want to
distribute.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Track batch performance
Open the Coupon report to review reserved and confirmed uses, discount
cost, and settled refunds by batch, seller, and currency.
